ren\u2019s concepts as stimuli for the designers\u2019 interpretations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So fruitful has been the outcome of just 2 years of co-design collaboration that a major exhibition is planned to showcase the children\u2019s concepts as stimuli for the designer\u2019s interpretations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here is a sneak preview.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1329\" height=\"708\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic.jpg\" alt=\"Frozen Walthamstow Drawing\" class=\"wp-image-3902 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic.jpg 1329w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic-300x160.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic-1024x546.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic-768x409.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic-360x192.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walthamstow-pic-200x107.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1329px) 100vw, 1329px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1329px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1329\/708;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1327\" height=\"564\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/frozen-walthamstow.jpg\" alt=\"Frozen Walthamstow\" class=\"wp-image-3903 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/frozen-walthamstow.jpg 1327w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/frozen-walthamstow-300x128.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/frozen-walthamstow-1024x435.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-a